{"id":"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-revision-theory.md","title":"经典修正算子及有限修正序列","display":"df-revision-theory — 经典修正算子及有限修正序列","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-revision-theory","aliases":["91-df-revision-theory","91-df-revision-sequence","91-df-Gupta-Belnap"],"display":"df-revision-theory — 经典修正算子及有限修正序列","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-revision-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-revision-theory</span><span>91-df-revision-sequence</span><span>91-df-Gupta-Belnap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-revision-theory — 经典修正算子及有限修正序列"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 表示经典一阶满足关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_T\">\\(C_T\\)</span> 为真理语言句子编码集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是初始真理外延；基础结构固定为标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Gamma^n\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^n\\)</span> 为下述修正算子及有限次复合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RevSeq}_{\\mathbb N}^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RevSeq}_{\\mathbb N}^{\\omega}\\)</span> 为有限阶段序列性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}revision\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Gamma(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ (\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\\Gamma^0(A)=A,\\quad\\Gamma^{n+1}(A)=\\Gamma(\\Gamma^n(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}revision\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Gamma(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ (\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\\Gamma^0(A)=A,\\quad\\Gamma^{n+1}(A)=\\Gamma(\\Gamma^n(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RevSeq}_{\\mathbb N}^{\\omega}(\\langle A_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,(A_{n+1}=\\Gamma(A_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RevSeq}_{\\mathbb N}^{\\omega}(\\langle A_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,(A_{n+1}=\\Gamma(A_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 §14.1 分析 FS 的经典修正：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 不是单调强 Kleene 跳跃 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>。原书明确只处理有限修正阶段；超限 Gupta–Belnap 序列另须选择极限规则，不能从本递归自动取得唯一极限。\n初始集合可含非句子编码，但一次修正后的输出仅含句子编码。说谎者在有限后继阶段交替；真理陈述者可保持初始选择。全体真理外延却不能在任何有限周期复现（Lemma 14.9），不能从说谎者二周期误推整个序列二周期。</p>\n<p>来源：§14.1，尤其印刷页 148–151，PDF 页 159–162；Lemma 14.9。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"C_T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Gamma^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RevSeq}_{\\mathbb N}^{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}revision\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\quad\n\\Gamma(A)\\coloneqq\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\ (\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\\Gamma^0(A)=A,\\quad\\Gamma^{n+1}(A)=\\Gamma(\\Gamma^n(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RevSeq}_{\\mathbb N}^{\\omega}(\\langle A_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,(A_{n+1}=\\Gamma(A_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":1795,"backlinks":[{"id":"ccf84662da3832c0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FS}_n$ 是 [[91-df-FS-n]] 的有限规则片段，$\\mathrm{FS}=\\bigcup_n\\mathrm{FS}_n$；$\\Gamma$ 是 [[91-df-revision-theory]] 的经典修正。"},{"id":"5349915a17c515d9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-revision-theory]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-d